      "reasoning": "The horn sounds! Our first Construct is ready to march. A 4/4 behemoth of steel and magic. The opponent has no creatures. It is time to strike!\n\nI attack with p56 (Construct Token, 4/4). The other Construct (p68) and Mite (p69) are summoning sick. The Spawn (p46) is 0/1, so it stays back.\n\nWait, I should check mana. I am tapped out. Attacking leaves me with no blockers except the sick Construct and Mite and Spawn. Opponent has 18 life. 4 damage is good. They have 4 cards in hand and 2 open mana (Mountain R, Mountain R, tapped Foundry R/W). They could have removal (Lightning Bolt, Unholy Heat). My Construct is 4/4. Bolt is 3 damage. Unholy Heat without delirium is 2 damage. With delirium it's 6.\nOpponent graveyard: Arid Mesa, Arid Mesa, Manamorphose, Pyretic Ritual, Wooded Foothills.\nCard types in GY: Land (Mesa/Wooded), Sorcery (Manamorphose/Ritual). Only 2 types. No delirium.\nSo Bolt and Heat are safe. Galvanic Blast (if they run it) is 2 damage without metalcraft.\nSo my 4/4 is likely safe unless they have double Bolt or path/terminate (unlikely in pure R/W energy/prowess unless Boros Charm or something).\n\nSo attacking is free damage.\n\n",
