      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Bottomed Desperate Ritual instead of the redundant second Ruby Medallion. Desperate Ritual is a key mana accelerant that nets +2 red mana with a Medallion in play, enabling explosive chaining of card draw spells. The second Ruby Medallion is largely redundant when you already have one.",
