    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "MiMo Rookie cast Manamorphose before playing Arid Mesa. Since Arid Mesa is a land that can be played for free and doesn't require mana, it should be played first. Playing the land first preserves options - Manamorphose draws a card, and the drawn card might influence whether to crack Arid Mesa or what color mana to add with Manamorphose. More importantly, with only 2 lands on board (both tapped), casting Manamorphose uses the mana that could have been used for Ruby Medallion if the land had been played first and untapped mana was available. However, Arid Mesa enters untapped but doesn't produce mana without being sacrificed (paying 1 life), so the sequencing issue is about information - playing Arid Mesa first, then Manamorphose to see the drawn card before deciding whether to crack the Mesa.",
